OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with some pleasant evening
OL,7,Fsunshine, then dry overnight with
OL,8,Flengthy clear spells. Some lower cloud
OL,9,Fpossible over the Pennines. The odd
OL,10,Fshower drifting in off the coast
OL,11,Fcannot be ruled out. Not as chilly as
OL,12,Frecent nights.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FStaying mostly dry, with
OL,15,Fspells of warm sunshine. The chance an
OL,16,Fisolated light showers drifting into
OL,17,Fnorthern parts is possible. Turning
OL,18,Fcloudier by the end of the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
